Package: devjam-mpv-config
Version: 1.1-5
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: mpv
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: mpv configs for the CLS lab monitors
 mpv configuration profiles for the monitors in the CLS lab and the
 switch-mpv-config command that installs the chosen profile as
 ~/.config/mpv/mpv.conf.
